			"\s[96]Zz... \w8incoming... \w8zzz...\e"
			"\s[96]Zzz... \w8that was not medicine... \w8zzzz...\e"
			"\s[97]Zzzzz... \w8zzrrk... \w8Dummkopfen...\e"
